'''Giftwrap''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2021 Christmas Box|Christmas Box]] during the [[Christmas Event 2021|2021 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
Giftwrap uses the same mesh as the [[Default Knife]], but appears to be wrapped up like a present with red ribbon across the blade, all the way down to the handle. The red ribbon on the blade also contains a red bow in the center. 

